# ============================================================
# Open Game Access — files that must NEVER be committed.
#
# ⛔ ROMs ARE COPYRIGHTED. This project's whole premise is that players supply
# their own game files. Nothing here may contain a ROM, a BIOS dump, a firmware
# image, a save file, or a patch derived from one.
# ============================================================

# --- game data: ROMs, BIOS, firmware, saves, savestates ---
*.nds
*.dsi
*.gba
*.gbc
*.gb
*.sav
*.srm
*.dsv
*.state
*.ss0
*.ss1
*.st0
*.SaveRAM
*.bs9
*.bs7
bios7.bin
bios9.bin
firmware.bin
bios*.bin
firmware*.bin
*.xip

# Every other platform the toolbox may eventually touch. Listed by extension so a
# stray `git add .` cannot sweep a disc image into a commit.
*.nes
*.fds
*.unf
*.smc
*.sfc
*.fig
*.swc
*.z64
*.n64
*.v64
*.rom
*.gbc
# ⛔ NOT `*.md` — that is the Mega Drive extension AND Markdown. A blanket `*.md`
# rule silently untracks every document in the repository. Mega Drive dumps are
# caught by the roms/ directory rules and by `oga-re`'s own ROM guard instead.
*.gen
*.smd
*.32x
*.sms
*.gg
*.pce
*.iso
*.img
*.bin
*.cue
*.chd
*.gcm
*.gcz
*.wbfs
*.wad
*.rvz
*.cso
*.pbp
*.vpk
*.elf
*.prx
*.dol
# Save states and SRAM in the emulators' own formats.
*.frz
*.p2s
*.mcr
*.mcd
*.mcs
*.mpk
*.ps2
*.psv
*.ss2
*.savestate
*.sram

# ROM-carrying directories (a stray `git add .` must not sweep these in)
roms/
Roms/
**/roms/
**/hosttest-data/
**/ds-bios/
Games/
**/roms/*

# --- vendored emulator source and its build output ---
# The core is fetched by scripts/, never committed: it is a separate GPL project
# with its own repository, and vendoring a copy invites drift and licence
# confusion. See README "Third-party components".
src/melonds-lua/
src/melonds-lua-irpatch/
src/lua-5.4.7/
src/mgba/
melonDS-android/
Vendor/
Vendor/*
!Vendor/.gitkeep
native/
*.a
*.o
*.obj
*.so
*.dylib

# --- reverse-engineering artefacts (contain game memory, no ROM bytes but still
#     not useful in a repo, and some are large) ---
fe/out/
fe/shots/
ramwatch/
rom-screen/
*.ram
*.ppm
*.zip

# --- build output ---
.build/
.xtool-tmp/
xtool/
xtool-sim/
app/build/
.gradle/
build/
*.apk
*.ipa
*.dSYM/

# --- per-machine config ---
local.properties
xcuserdata/
*.xcworkspace
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# --- secrets: never commit tokens, keys or provisioning profiles ---
*.p12
*.mobileprovision
*.pem
*.key
.env
secrets*
